OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry started into town's high
OL,4,Ainfant death rate
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation is under way into why
OL,7,FRugby has recorded a significantly
OL,8,Fhigher infant mortality rate than the
OL,9,Fnational average in recent years.
OL,11,FThese statistics measure infant
OL,12,Fmortality as the number of children who
OL,13,Fdie before their first birthday for
OL,14,Fevery 1,000 live births.
OL,16,FIn 2024, Rugby recorded an infant
OL,17,Fmortality rate of 9.3 per 1,000 live
OL,18,Fbirths, compared with 3.9 nationally,
OL,19,F7.3 across the West Midlands and 3.8
OL,20,Facross Warwickshire.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
