OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry started into town's high
OL,4,Ainfant death rate
OL,5,
OL,6,FFigures from the Office for National
OL,7,FStatistics show there were 11 infant
OL,8,Fdeaths among 1,180 live births in the
OL,9,Fborough last year, accounting for half
OL,10,Fof the 22 infant deaths recorded across
OL,11,FWarwickshire's five districts.
